			"widgets_values":[
				"enhance this image.  Restore this image to a clean high-resolution version while preserving the original image exactly.  Keep the same identity, same face, same pose, same composition, same camera angle, same perspective, same objects, same background, same lighting, same colors, and same visual style.  Only recover missing details, remove blur and compression artifacts, and improve natural clarity.  Do not redesign, do not change, do not add, do not remove, do not beautify, do not stylize, do not alter any elements of the original image.A high-quality, ultra-realistic digital character portrait of Rikku from Final Fantasy X as a Racing Queen. The character has a youthful, beautiful face with bright green eyes, a gentle smile, and long blonde hair styled in a high, voluminous ponytail with intricate braids and colorful beads. She wears professional racing goggles pushed up onto her forehead, integrated with a headset.\n\nShe is dressed in a stylish racing-themed outfit: a cropped black and yellow leather motorcycle jacket, a matching black and yellow bikini-style top, and a short, fitted black leather skirt with yellow accents and various technical gear, belts, and small pouches attached. She wears fingerless leather racing gloves and a thigh-high garter strap with the number \"10\" on her leg.\n\nThe composition is a medium shot, capturing her from the waist up. She stands with one hand on her hip, looking directly at the camera with a confident, friendly expression. The background is a clean, bright studio setting featuring a blurred, high-tech racing car with yellow and white livery. \n\nThe lighting is bright, professional studio lighting that highlights the textures of the leather, skin, and metallic hardware. The image incorporates graphic design elements including sleek white margins, technical text overlays, \"FINAL FANTASY X\" and \"RIKKU\" branding, and a \"SEVENTH HEAVEN RACING\" logo, mimicking a high-end promotional poster or magazine cover. The overall aesthetic is a blend of hyper-realistic 3D character rendering and professional commercial photography."
